# HKBank.lsr
# Hong Kong bank routing rules for Loon
# Updated: 2026-08-08
#
# Scope:
# - Hong Kong consumer-facing retail banks and digital banks.
# - Current official bank domains, plus a small number of bank-specific app/support endpoints
#   cross-checked against maintained HK bank rulesets.
# - Policy is intentionally omitted. Assign this remote ruleset to your HK-bank/HK policy in Loon.
# - Generic shared analytics/CDN/cloud-ASN rules are intentionally excluded to avoid routing
#   unrelated apps through the bank policy.

# ==================== Major / retail banks ====================

# HSBC Hong Kong / 香港汇丰
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hk.hsbc.com
# HSBC-owned HK cloud namespace used by HK services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vam-hk.cloud1.vv1865.com

# Hang Seng Bank / 恒生银行
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hangseng.com

# Bank of China (Hong Kong) / 中国银行（香港）
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bochk.com
# BOC Credit Card (International) / BOCHK card services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,boccc.com.hk
# Known BOCHK market-data endpoints used by app/services
DOMAIN,bochk01.etnet.com.hk
DOMAIN,bochk02.etnet.com.hk
DOMAIN,bochkapp01.etnet.com.hk
DOMAIN,bochk.yundzh.com
DOMAIN,saaszhhk.yundzh.com

# Bank of East Asia / 东亚银行
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hkbea.com

# Standard Chartered Hong Kong / 渣打香港
# sc.com is the bank's global domain; Hong Kong services are under sc.com/hk.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sc.com
# Legacy/compatibility domain still referenced by SC Hong Kong
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sc.com.hk

# Citibank Hong Kong / 花旗香港
